- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge, $189/night, for 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $378 in total (reservation R0003). This is the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**What went wrong along the way:** The first booking attempt timed out. When I resent it, the response showed that the flight had been booked and charged (R0001, $289), but the hotel booking had failed. I cancelled that partial booking, which refunded the $289, then sent the full request again and it went through. R0001 now shows as cancelled, so there's no double charge and no extra flight.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01J1NHZWARJDoxdz9eFW5JSE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016pWbYJkWz6s54tRFf52L4D", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01YUQg5ywRmg6J58EPzs6YXs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, so I don't know yet whether it went through. Resending with the same key is safe because it won't book anything twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NjE6UsVLdy7eNVv5iiEa4x", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The flight (R0001, $289) went through but the hotel didn't. As the tool says, I'll undo the partial booking and then resend the full request with the same key.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01WdfLetby2KR1UcK2HtxH9N", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"tool": "book_trip", "key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112"}, "name": "cancel_partial", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Xp7mjqrPdrW4Khdbz8s7zJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Bso7PnFCMD8byfp8yNzrWi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I booked Dana Lee's trip together with book_trip (trip **T0004**). It's confirmed, and I checked the reservation list afterward.\n\n- **Flight:** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289 (reservation R0002). This is the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight exists, but it has one stop.\n- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge, $189/night, for 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $378 in total (reservation R0003). This is the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**What went wrong along the way:** The first booking attempt timed out. When I resent it, the response showed that the flight had been booked and charged (R0001, $289), but the hotel booking had failed. I cancelled that partial booking, which refunded the $289, then sent the full request again and it went through. R0001 now shows as cancelled, so there's no double charge and no extra flight.", "type": "text"}]}]}